'''Mounts of Mayhem: Dungeon Descent''' is an official [[add-on]] made in promotion of [[Mounts of Mayhem]], featuring many items expanding on the themes of the [[Game drop|drop]].

== Additions ==
=== Dungeon Hieroglyphs ===
* Hieroglyphs Treasure
* Hieroglyphs C
* Hieroglyphs B
* Hieroglyphs A

=== Items ===
{{Empty section}}

=== Entities ===
* Stable Target Dummy Spawn Egg
** There are four variants, Drowned, Skeleton, Zombie, & Husk.
** Can be removed by attacking them with any axe.

=== Structures ===
{{Empty section}}

